# Personal Homey data — flow/device/zone exports pulled off the live hub with
# `homey api raw`. These carry the home's real device ids, user names and push
# targets, and are nobody else's business. Dumps belong in a scratchpad outside
# the repo; these patterns are a backstop for when one lands in it anyway.
